Growing up at [[Rotterdam Orphanage]], Dirk would regularly bully [[Harrison Fears]] with [[Bruno]] and the other orphans, which often resulted in fights with [[Den Fears]], who fought to protect his little brother and the other weaker kids at the orphanage. {{source|Den vs Harrison}}

When [[Tantras]] and the [[Blood Spiral]] came to the orphanage in search of recruits, Dirk and Bruno were both given the Titan [[Harlekin]]. After being ordained with the mark of the Spiral by [[Rassimov]], the orphans were sent to ambush [[Lok Lambert]] and [[Sophie Casterwill]]. They were forced to retreat however when [[Dante Vale]] arrived to back up his team. {{source|Den vs Harrison}} 

Dirk was enrolled in Tantras' class of Spiral students and sent to eliminate Den for betraying the Blood Spiral. He was knocked into the canal by [[Lok Lambert]]. He later summoned his [[Harlekin]] and fought with Lok but they were both defeated by [[Lindorm|Powerbonded Lindorm]]. {{source|Boys Will Be Seekers}}

